# Render from the repo root: vhs assets/tapes/table.tape
Output assets/table.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 560
Set Height 330
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='> ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "bun examples/table.ts"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 350ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Up
Sleep 350ms
Up
Sleep 1.2s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
